<title>UK: ICCO lists buffer stock cocoa for sale in July.</title>
<headline>ICCO lists buffer stock cocoa for sale in July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The buffer stock manager of the International Cocoa Organization (ICCO) announced on Tuesday the buffer stock sales planned for July would total a maximum 4,251 tonnes and would comprise the following cocoa, an ICCO statement said.</p>
<p>The date of the sale has yet to be announced.</p>
<p>Details of the cocoa offered for sale are as follows.</p>
<p> TONNES   ORIGIN	     PORT	 CROP	  QUALITY</p>
<p> 150	Cameroon	   Amsterdam  1981/82     good fermented</p>
<p>  54	Cameroon	   Amsterdam  1981/82     fair fermented</p>
<p> 101	Cameroon	   Amsterdam  1982/83     good fermented</p>
<p> 547	Ivory Coast	Amsterdam  1981/82     good fermented</p>
<p> 447	Ivory Coast	Amsterdam  1981/82     fair fermented</p>
<p> 100	Ivory Coast	Amsterdam  1982/83     good fermented</p>
<p> 296	Ivory Coast	Amsterdam  1982/83     fair fermented</p>
<p>  99	Ivory Coast	Amsterdam  1983/84     good fermented</p>
<p>  49	Ivory Coast	Amsterdam  1983/84     fair fermented</p>
<p> 100	Ivory Coast	Amsterdam  1987/88     good fermented</p>
<p> 336	Ivory Coast	Amsterdam  1987/88     fair fermented</p>
<p> TONNES   ORIGIN	     PORT	 CROP	  QUALITY</p>
<p> 445	Ghana		Amsterdam  1981/82     good fermented</p>
<p>  99	Ghana		Amsterdam  1981/82     fair fermented</p>
<p> 212	Ghana		Amsterdam  1986/87     good fermented</p>
<p>  49	Ghana		Amsterdam  1986/87     fair fermented</p>
<p> 597	Ghana		Amsterdam  1987/88     good fermented</p>
<p>  99	Ghana		Amsterdam  1987/88     fair fermented</p>
<p>  99	Malaysia	   Amsterdam  1981/82     good fermented</p>
<p> 124	Malaysia	   Amsterdam  1987/88     good fermented</p>
<p>  99	Nigeria	    Amsterdam  1981/82     good fermented</p>
<p> 149	Nigeria	    Amsterdam  1981/82     fair fermented</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
